announcement-anomaly-bioscrambler-text = Biologic limb swapping agent detected on long range scanners. Expected location: { $area }. Wear biosuits or other protective gear to counter the effects.

announcement-anomaly-bluespace-detected-text = Bluespace instability detected on long range scanners. Expected location: { $area }.

announcement-anomaly-dimensional-detected-text = Dimensional instability detected on long range scanners. Expected location: { $area }.

announcement-anomaly-ectoplasm-detected-text = Paranormal ectoplasmic outburst detected on localized scanners. Detected location: { $area }.

announcement-anomaly-hyper-flux-text = Hyper-energetic flux wave detected on localized scanners. Detected location: { $area }.

announcement-anomaly-gravity-text = Gravitational anomaly detected on localized scanners. Detected location: { $area }.

announcement-anomaly-hallucination-text = Hallucinatory event detected on long range scanners. Expected location: { $area }.

announcement-anomaly-pyro-text = Pyroclastic anomaly detected on localized scanners. Detected location: { $area }.

announcement-anomaly-vortex-text = Localized high-intensity vortex anomaly detected on localized scanners. Detected location: { $area }

announcement-anomaly-barometric-text = Barometric anomaly detected on localized scanners. Detected location: { $area }.

announcement-anomaly-barometric-severe-text = Severe barometric anomaly detected on localized scanners. Detected location: { $area }.

announcement-anomaly-energetic-flux-text = Energetic flux wave detected on localized scanners. Detected location: { $area }.

announcement-sender-meteorology = Nanotrasen Meteorology Division

announcement-aurora-start-text = { $station }: A harmless cloud of ions is approaching your station, and will exhaust their energy battering the hull. Nanotrasen has approved a short break for all employees to relax and observe this very rare event. During this time, starlight will be bright but gentle, shifting between quiet green and blue colors. Any staff who would like to view these lights for themselves may proceed to the area nearest to them with viewing ports to open space. We hope you enjoy the lights.

announcement-aurora-end-text = The aurora caelus event is now ending. Starlight conditions will slowly return to normal. When this has concluded, please return to your workplace and continue work as normal. Have a pleasant shift, { $station }, and thank you for watching with us.

announcement-brand-intelligence-title = Machine Learning Alert

announcement-brand-intelligence-text = Rampant brand intelligence has been detected aboard { $station }. Please inspect any { $machine } brand vendors for aggressive marketing tactics, and reboot them if necessary.

announcement-bureaucratic-error-title = Paperwork Mishap Alert

announcement-bureaucratic-error-text = A recent bureaucratic error in the Organic Resources Department may result in personnel shortages in some departments and redundant staffing in others.

announcement-carp-migration-title = Lifesign Alert

announcement-carp-migration-text = { $signal } have been detected near { $station }, please stand-by.

announcement-carp-signal-default = Unknown biological entities

announcement-carp-signal-magic = Unknown magical entities

