announcement-disease-outbreak-title = { $illness } Alert

announcement-disease-outbreak-text = Confirmed outbreak of level 7 viral biohazard aboard { $station }. All personnel must contain the outbreak.

announcement-earthquake-title = Seismic Report

announcement-earthquake-text = Planetary monitoring systems indicate a devastating seismic event in the near future.

announcement-electrical-storm-title = Electrical Storm Alert

announcement-electrical-storm-text = An electrical storm has been detected in your area, please repair potential electronic overloads.

announcement-header-medium-priority = { $sender } Medium-Priority Update

announcement-gravity-blackout-text = Gravnospheric anomalies detected near { $station }. Manual reset of generators is required.

announcement-grey-tide-title = Security Alert

announcement-grey-tide-text = Gr3y.T1d3 virus detected in { $station } secure locking encryption subroutines. Severity level of { $severity }. Recommend station AI involvement.

announcement-easter-text-1 = Hip-hop into Easter!

announcement-easter-text-2 = Find some Bunny's stash!

announcement-easter-text-3 = Today is National 'Hunt a Wabbit' Day.

announcement-easter-text-4 = Be kind, give Chocolate Eggs!

announcement-rabbits-title = Fluffy Alert

announcement-rabbits-text = Unidentified furry objects detected coming aboard { $station }. Beware of Adorable-ness.

announcement-halloween-text-1 = RATTLE ME BONES!

announcement-halloween-text-2 = THE RIDE NEVER ENDS!

announcement-halloween-text-3 = A SKELETON POPS OUT!

announcement-halloween-text-4 = SPOOKY SCARY SKELETONS!

announcement-halloween-text-5 = CREWMEMBERS BEWARE, YOU'RE IN FOR A SCARE!

announcement-halloween-title = THE CALL IS COMING FROM INSIDE THE HOUSE

announcement-valentines-text = It's Valentine's Day! Give a valentine to that special someone!

announcement-santa-title = Unknown Transmission

announcement-santa-text = Santa is coming to town!

announcement-immovable-rod-title = General Alert

announcement-immovable-rod-text = What the fuck was that?!

announcement-ion-storm-text = Ion storm detected near the station. Please check all AI-controlled equipment for errors.

announcement-sender-accounting = Nanotrasen Accounting Division

announcement-market-crash-reason-1 = the alignment of the moon and the sun

announcement-market-crash-reason-2 = some risky housing market outcomes

announcement-market-crash-reason-3 = the B.E.P.I.S. team's untimely downfall

announcement-market-crash-reason-4 = speculative Terragov grants backfiring

announcement-market-crash-reason-5 = greatly exaggerated reports of Nanotrasen accountancy personnel being "laid off"

announcement-market-crash-reason-6 = a "great investment" into "non-fungible tokens" by a "moron"

announcement-market-crash-reason-7 = a number of raids from Tiger Cooperative agents

announcement-market-crash-reason-8 = supply chain shortages

announcement-market-crash-reason-9 = the "Nanotrasen+" social media network's untimely downfall

announcement-market-crash-reason-10 = the "Nanotrasen+" social media network's unfortunate success

announcement-market-crash-reason-11 = uhh, bad luck, we guess

announcement-market-crash-up-text = Due to { $reason }, prices for on-station vendors will be increased for a short period.

announcement-market-crash-down-text = Prices for on-station vendors have now stabilized.

announcement-dark-matteor-text = Warning. Excessive tampering of meteor satellites has attracted a dark matt-eor. Signature approaching { $station }. Please brace for impact.

announcement-meteor-wave-text = Meteors have been detected on collision course with the station.

announcement-meaty-title = Oh crap, get the mop.

announcement-meaty-text = Meaty ores have been detected on collision course with the station.

announcement-collision-alert-title = Collision Alert

announcement-dust-storm-text-1 = { $station } is passing through a debris cloud, expect minor damage to external fittings and fixtures.

announcement-dust-storm-text-2 = Nanotrasen Superweapons Division is testing a new prototype { $field } { $weapon }, some mild debris is expected.

announcement-dust-storm-text-3 = A neighbouring station is throwing rocks at you. (Perhaps they've grown tired of your messages.)

announcement-dust-storm-text-4 = { $station }'s orbit is passing through a cloud of remnants from an asteroid mining operation. Minor hull damage is to be expected.

announcement-dust-storm-text-5 = A large meteoroid on intercept course with { $station } has been demolished. Residual debris may impact the station exterior.

announcement-dust-storm-text-6 = { $station } has hit a particularly rough patch of space. Please mind any turbulence or damage from debris.

announcement-dust-storm-field-1 = field

announcement-dust-storm-field-2 = projection

announcement-dust-storm-field-3 = nova

announcement-dust-storm-field-4 = super-colliding

announcement-dust-storm-field-5 = reactive

announcement-dust-storm-weapon-1 = cannon

announcement-dust-storm-weapon-2 = artillery

announcement-dust-storm-weapon-3 = tank

announcement-dust-storm-weapon-4 = cruiser

announcement-dust-storm-weapon-5 = [REDACTED]

announcement-stray-meteor-text = Our { $sensor } sensors have detected an incoming signature approaching { $station }. Please brace for impact.

announcement-portal-storm-text = Massive bluespace anomaly detected en route to { $station }. Brace for impact.

announcement-radiation-storm-text = High levels of radiation detected near the station. Maintenance is best shielded from radiation.

announcement-radiation-storm-end-text = The radiation threat has passed. Please return to your workplaces.

announcement-sender-engineering = { $sender } Engineering Division

announcement-radiation-leak-text = A radiation leak has been detected in { $location }. All crew are to evacuate the affected area. Our { $source } report that a machine within is causing it - repair it quickly to stop the leak.

announcement-radiation-leak-unknown-area = an unknown area

announcement-radiation-leak-source-1 = mechanics

announcement-radiation-leak-source-2 = engineers

announcement-radiation-leak-source-3 = scientists

announcement-radiation-leak-source-4 = interns

announcement-radiation-leak-source-5 = sensors

announcement-radiation-leak-source-6 = readings

announcement-sandstorm-title = Collision Emergency Alert

announcement-sandstorm-text = A large wave of space dust is approaching from the { $side } side of the station. Impact is expected in the next two minutes. All employees are encouraged to assist in repairs and damage mitigation if possible.

announcement-sandstorm-side-fore = fore

announcement-sandstorm-side-aft = aft

announcement-sandstorm-side-starboard = starboard

announcement-sandstorm-side-port = port

announcement-scrubber-overflow-text = The scrubbers network is experiencing a backpressure surge. Some ejection of contents may occur.

announcement-tram-malf-text = Our automated control system has lost contact with the tram's onboard computer. Please stand by, engineering has been dispatched to the tram to perform a reset.

announcement-tram-rod-title = Braking News

announcement-tram-rod-text-1 = In a turn of rather peculiar events, it appears that { $station } has struck an immovable rod. (Don't ask us where it came from.) This has led to a station brakes failure on one of the tram platforms.

announcement-tram-rod-text-2 = Our diligent team of engineers have been informed and they're rushing over - although not quite at the speed of our recently flying tram.

announcement-tram-rod-text-3 = So while we all look in awe at the universe's mysterious sense of humour, please stand clear of the tracks and remember to stand behind the yellow line.

announcement-blob-title = Biohazard Alert

announcement-blob-text = Confirmed outbreak of level 5 biohazard aboard { $station }. All personnel must contain the outbreak.

announcement-malf-ai-text = Hostile runtimes detected in all station systems, please deactivate your AI to prevent possible damage to its morality core.

announcement-sender-higher-dimensions = { $sender } Higher Dimensional Affairs

announcement-cult-summon-text = Figments from an eldritch god are being summoned by { $user } into { $area } from an unknown dimension. Disrupt the ritual at all costs!

announcement-sender-lighting = Automated Lighting System Announcement

announcement-nightshift-night-text = Good evening, crew. To reduce power consumption and stimulate the circadian rhythms of some species, all of the lights aboard the station have been dimmed for the night.

announcement-nightshift-day-text = Good morning, crew. As it is now day time, all of the lights aboard the station have been restored to their former brightness.

announcement-nightshift-restore-text = Restoring night lighting configuration to normal operation.

announcement-nightshift-disable-text = Disabling night lighting: Station is in a state of emergency.

announcement-supermatter-surge-title = Class { $class } Supermatter Surge Alert

announcement-supermatter-surge-text = The Crystal Integrity Monitoring System has detected unusual atmospheric properties in the supermatter chamber, energy output from the supermatter crystal has increased significantly. Engineering intervention is required to stabilize the engine.

announcement-supermatter-surge-parrot-text = The Crystal Integrity Monitoring System has detected unusual parrot type resonance in the supermatter chamber, energy output from the supermatter crystal has increased significantly. Engineering intervention is required to stabilize the engine.

announcement-supermatter-surge-end-title = Anomaly Cleared

announcement-supermatter-surge-end-text = The supermatter surge has dissipated, crystal output readings have normalized.

announcement-vent-clog-title = Custodial Notification

announcement-vent-clog-text = Minor biological obstruction detected in the ventilation network. Blockage is believed to be in the { $area }.

announcement-vent-move-title = Lifesign Notification

announcement-vent-move-text = Lifesign readings have moved to a new location in the ventilation network. New Location: { $location }.

announcement-vent-move-unknown = Unknown

announcement-vent-major-title = Infestation Alert

announcement-vent-major-text = Major biological obstruction detected in the ventilation network. Blockage is believed to be in the { $area } area.

announcement-vent-critical-text = Potentially hazardous lifesigns detected in the { $area } ventilation network.

announcement-vent-strange-text = Unusual lifesign readings detected in the { $area } ventilation network.

announcement-sender-cow = Nanotrasen Cow Ranching Agency

announcement-wisdom-cow-text = A wise cow has been spotted in the area. Be sure to ask for her advice.

announcement-object-rain-title = Janitorial alert

announcement-object-rain-text = Anomalous weather patterns forecast in the { $region }.

announcement-wormholes-text = Space-time anomalies detected on the station. There is no additional data.

announcement-meteor-shield-title = Strange Meteor Signal Warning

announcement-meteor-shield-text = Warning. Tampering of meteor satellites puts the station at risk of exotic, deadly meteor collisions. Please intervene by checking your GPS devices for strange signals, and dismantling the tampered meteor shields.

announcement-station-goal-title = Incoming Priority Message

announcement-station-goal-text = Priority Nanotrasen directive received. Project "{ $name }" details inbound.

announcement-dark-matteor-missed-title = Meteor Update

announcement-dark-matteor-missed-text = Wow. The Dark Matt-eor actually missed your station. Don't forget to thank your Chaplain for his apparent divine intervention.

announcement-nebula-radiation-text-1 = Is everything okay there? We're getting high radiation readings from inside the station. We're sending an emergency shielding unit for now, it will last { $time }.

announcement-nebula-radiation-text-2 = Set up the nebula shielding. You can order construction kits at cargo if yours have been lost.

announcement-duration-minutes-decimal = { $count } { $count ->
    [one] minute
   *[other] minutes
 }

announcement-nebula-intro-text-1 = Your station has been constructed inside a radioactive nebula. Standard spacesuits will not protect against the nebula and using them is strongly discouraged.

announcement-nebula-intro-text-2 = EXTREME IMPORTANCE: The station is falling deeper into the nebula, and the gravity generator's innate radiation shielding will not hold very long. Your engineering department has been supplied with all the necessary supplies to set up shields to protect against the nebula. Additional supply crates can be ordered at cargo.

announcement-nebula-intro-text-3 = You have { $deadline } before the nebula enters the station. Every shielding unit will provide an additional { $shielder } of protection, fully protecting the station with { $count } shielding units.

announcement-stray-cargo-text = Stray cargo pod detected on long-range scanners. Expected location of impact: { $area }.
